     "status": "told",
     "learned_at_minute": -45
    },
    {
     "id": "k_not_commissioned_27s",
     "text": "Power and network were tested at install, but no test flight was done because there was no certified pilot on site.",
     "said_by": "Dana Whitfield",
     "status": "verified",
     "verified_by": "K_install_note_27s",
     "learned_at_minute": -40
    },
    {
     "id": "k_no_pilot_27s",
     "text": "Nobody at the estate holds a drone pilot certificate. Dana assumed the system flies itself once switched on.",
     "said_by": "Dana Whitfield",
     "status": "told",
     "learned_at_minute": -38
    },
    {
     "id": "k_insurer_not_told_27s",
     "text": "The property insurance requires any new aerial equipment to be notified before use. The dock is not declared.",
     "said_by": "Lucy Pratt",
     "status": "verified",
     "verified_by": "K_insurance_schedule_27s",
     "learned_at_minute": -30
    },
    {
     "id": "k_need_entrances_27s",
     "text": "What the estate needs is night patrol of the two entrances. The sales pitch was about mapping the whole estate, which they do not need.",
     "said_by": "Dana Whitfield",
     "status": "told",
     "learned_at_minute": -25
    },
    {
     "id": "k_board_pays_27s",
     "text": "Any spend beyond the original purchase needs a vote of the residents' board, which meets on the first Monday of each month.",
     "said_by": "Graham Okafor",
     "status": "told",
     "learned_at_minute": -20
    },
    {
     "id": "k_board_doubts_27s",
     "text": "Some residents already ask why they paid for a drone that has never flown.",
     "said_by": "Graham Okafor",
     "status": "told",
